1. invalid signed download tokens currently raise instead of returning 404;
2. one test incorrectly relied on request-scoped `Current.user` outside a request;
3. the import submission didn’t queue, likely due either global-route redirect behavior or attachment validation.

I’ll fix the controller’s invalid-token handling and test helpers, then inspect the import response/log directly before changing application behavior.

